-- statement:
--   **The level cost bound.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6ILLevCost`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.IL.cLevBody_le [NeZero W] (C : Bit.QHNet (ZMod 2) W T m) (P L' h v Bb : ℕ)
--       (cC : ℕ × ℕ × ℕ → ℕ) (hP : 1 ≤ P) (hL : 1 ≤ L') (hh : 1 ≤ h) (hv : P * L' * h = v) :
--       cLevBody C P L' h v Bb cC ≤ levB C v Bb + ((runsL C).map cC).sum
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Round six, item language: the cost of one level body
--
--   `cLevBody_le`: the cost of `levBody C` on streams of volume `v` is at most
--   `levB C v Bb = KL C · (10^14 ((T + W) v + 1) + 10^11 (Bb + 2)²)` plus the costs of the child
--   calls of all runs of all edges (`runsL C`).
